    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even want to stop performing in small ways. i want it to all just stop. everything. the noise, the expectations, the constant feeling of just... needing to exist. it feels like there's no actual way to get true peace, you know? like, even when i sleep, i'm still just me when i wake up. it's just an endless cycle of nothingness.",
